```mermaid
graph TD
    Client[Client App / Mobile] -->|POST /personalize| API[FastAPI Application]
    Client -->|POST /debug/personalization| API

    subgraph API Layer
        API --> Mw[Middleware: Latency, Prompt Size & Logging]
        Mw --> Router[API Routers]
    end

    subgraph Upstream Microservice Layer
        Router -->|Async Gather| UpstreamMgr[Upstream Client Manager]
        UpstreamMgr -->|Check TTL| Cache[(In-Memory TTL Cache)]
        UpstreamMgr -->|GET /users/id| UserSvc[User Microservice]
        UpstreamMgr -->|GET /kundli/id| KundliSvc[Kundli Microservice]
        UpstreamMgr -->|GET /horoscope/id| HoroSvc[Horoscope Microservice]
        UpstreamMgr -->|GET /panchang| PanchSvc[Panchang Microservice]
    end

    subgraph Intelligence Engine Layer
        Router --> Engine[Personalization Engine Orchestrator]
        Engine --> Intent[Intent Detection Engine]
        Engine --> ConfigEngine[Config-Driven Context Selector]
        ConfigEngine -->|Load Mapping Rules| Rules[personalization_rules.json]
        Engine --> PromptBuilder[Prompt Builder]
    end

    subgraph LLM Provider Abstraction
        Engine --> LLMFactory[LLM Provider Factory]
        LLMFactory -->|Default Offline| MockLLM[Mock LLM Provider]
        LLMFactory -->|Optional API Key| GeminiLLM[Google Gemini Provider]
        LLMFactory -->|Optional API Key| OpenAILLM[OpenAI GPT Provider]
    end

    LLMFactory -->|Grounded Response| Client
```
